{"status":"answered","explanation":"The evidence provides details on the expenditure and attempts related to the Nicomedia aqueduct.","claims":[{"text":"The citizens of Nicomedia spent three million three hundred and twenty-nine sesterces on an aqueduct that was not finished, leading to further expenses for water accommodation.","citations":[{"id":"pliny:XLVI:1","path":"vault/raw/pliny.html#link2H_4_0157","quote":"THE citizens of Nicomedia, Sir, have expended three millions three hundred and twenty-nine sesterces in building an aqueduct; but, not being able to finish it, the works are entirely falling to ruin."}]}
